		(property "Description" "Synchronous boost converter, 0.5-5.5 V in, 2.2-5.5 V out, 3.7 A typ / 2.7 A min valley current limit, 1 MHz, internally compensated, SOT-563 (DRL0006A) | TI TPS61023DRLR | LCSC C919459. Symbol geometry imported verbatim from the Ultra Librarian KiCad v6 export (2026-07-26). Base-station V_LORA boost, replaces LM5157QRTERQ1, rail retargeted 7.49 V -> 4.95 V via a 732k/100k divider (TI datasheet Fig 8-1 values). NOTE: Ultra Librarian types SW and VOUT as power_in; VOUT is really an output, so ERC will want a PWR_FLAG on V_LORA unless that pin type is changed to power_out."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "LCSC_Part_Number" "C919459"
			(at 0 0 0)
