		(property "Description" "One-cell Li-ion protection IC, SOT-23-6 | DW01A | LCSC C351410 (PUOLOP). Overcharge 4.30 V +/-50 mV, release 4.10 V; over-discharge 2.40 V, release 3.00 V; overcurrent 150 mV across the external FET stack, short-circuit 1.2 V; Iq 3 uA. Drives LOW-SIDE N-FETs only (no charge pump), so it sits in the battery NEGATIVE path: VCC via 1k+100nF to cell +, GND to cell - (B-), VM to board GND (P-) via 2k, OD/OC to the two gates. Replaces MAX17303G+ on the base station together with 2x FS8205A. Pin 2 is named VM here; some DW01 datasheets label the same pin CS. Pinout from the LCSC/EasyEDA library for C351410, corroborated by the DW01A datasheet."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
