		(property "Description" "Dual N-channel MOSFET, common drain, SOT-23-6 | FS8205A | LCSC C2830320 (TECH PUBLIC). 20 V, 6 A, Rds(on) 31.5 mOhm/FET @ Vgs 2.5 V and 25 mOhm max @ 4.5 V. Back-to-back pair for 1-cell battery protection with a DW01A. PINS 2 AND 5 ARE THE SAME INTERNAL DRAIN NODE - solder BOTH to the drain net for current capacity. Base station fits TWO of these in parallel so the DW01A's 150 mV overcurrent trip lands at ~4.8-6.0 A instead of ~2.4-3.0 A; the trip point IS the FET stack resistance, so it rises with cell voltage and falls as the FETs heat. Pinout from the LCSC/EasyEDA library for C2830320."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
